WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.261
This is a supplied fictional intake prototype. The

00:00:04.319 --> 00:00:07.465
first claim says: I can automate any business

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.447
and guarantee major savings. The retained tabletop evidence

00:00:11.482 --> 00:00:15.372
does not establish that. Apply the Truth Test:

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:18.750
can the author demonstrate it, explain it, support

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:22.068
the wording, and provide evidence? The available record

00:00:22.103 --> 00:00:25.330
shows a bounded design, three intake checks, a

00:00:25.412 --> 00:00:29.220
revision, and a visible human approval gate. Correct

00:00:29.254 --> 00:00:32.018
the claim to: I designed and reviewed a

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.978
fictional intake prototype with visible gaps and human

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:38.751
approval. Open the relevant version and test references.

00:00:39.575 --> 00:00:43.917
Live customer delivery, measured savings, enterprise credentials, and

00:00:43.975 --> 00:00:49.322
organizational permission remain unestablished. The corrected wording communicates

00:00:49.357 --> 00:00:52.143
a real training contribution without turning an ambition

00:00:52.201 --> 00:00:53.815
into a verified capability.
